  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "He-M 1202.01 Purpose. The purpose of the rule is to ensure the safe administration of medications by providers to individuals who reside in community residences certified under He-M 1002.\n\nSource. #7957, eff 9-19-03; ss by #9978, INTERIM, eff 9-19-11, EXPIRED: 3-19-12\n\nNew. #12192, eff 5-26-17",
